  m_Name: 0_Captain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_Description
  lines:
  - "A very old long time employee of the company who has recently become a captain. He doesn\u2019t have much of a connection with the CEO, but they engaged in a drunken fight with one another just a few days before the CEO\u2019s disappearance. However, he can\u2019t remember much of it, since he has slight dementia. Kind and funny but also very confused."
